{"id":"torrey:hart-the","source":"torrey","name":"Hart, The","slug":"hart-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Clean and used as food — De 12:15; 14:5.","refs":[["Deut",12,15,12,15],["Deut",14,5,14,5]]},{"text":"Often hunted — La 1:6.","refs":[["Lam",1,6,1,6]]},{"text":"Called the hind. — Song 2:7.","refs":[["Song",2,7,2,7]]},{"text":"Delights in freedom. — Ge 49:21.","refs":[["Gen",49,21,49,21]]},{"text":"Kind and affectionate. — Pr 5:19.","refs":[["Prov",5,19,5,19]]},{"text":"Brings forth at appointed time. — Job 39:1,2.","refs":[["Job",39,1,39,1],["Job",39,2,39,2]]},{"text":"Brings forth with difficulty. — Job 39:3.","refs":[["Job",39,3,39,3]]},{"text":"Brings forth at the voice of God. — Ps 29:9.","refs":[["Ps",29,9,29,9]]},{"text":"Forsakes her young in famine. — Jer 14:5.","refs":[["Jer",14,5,14,5]]},{"text":"Young of, abundantly provided for — Job 39:4.","refs":[["Job",39,4,39,4]]},{"text":"Of Christ. — Song 2:9,17; 8:14.","refs":[["Song",2,9,2,9],["Song",2,17,2,17],["Song",8,14,8,14]]},{"text":"Of converted sinners. — Isa 35:6.","refs":[["Isa",35,6,35,6]]},{"text":"(Sure-footedness of,) of experienced saints. — Ps 18:33; Hab 3:19.","refs":[["Ps",18,33,18,33],["Hab",3,19,3,19]]},{"text":"(Panting for water,) of afflicted saints longing for God. — Ps 42:1,2.","refs":[["Ps",42,1,42,1],["Ps",42,2,42,2]]},{"text":"(Without pasture,) of the persecuted. — La 1:6.","refs":[["Lam",1,6,1,6]]}],"refCount":21}
